    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within the popular and well-maintained Corabby Court development, this attractive two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nPresented in good order throughout, the apartment is bright, spacious and well laid out, with accommodation designed to maximise both comfort and practicality. The property features a welcoming entrance hall, a generous open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, a separate utility room, two well-proportioned bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite, and a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor position provides easy access and added convenience, making this an excellent choice for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors alike. The property also benefits from a designated parking space and ample visitors' parking and will be sold with vacant possession, allowing for an immediate move-in or investment opportunity.\r\n\r\nCorabby Court enjoys an excellent location just a short walk from the bustling Main Street of Midleton, where an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and everyday amenities are on your doorstep. The town also offers excellent schools, leisure facilities and Midleton Train Station, while the nearby N25 provides easy access to Cork City, Little Island and beyond, making it an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a well-maintained apartment in a sought-after residential setting, offering convenience, comfort and excellent connectivity."
      },
      {
